		{
			"id":"c6c83c11f8fff85f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"`research.md`",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":894,
			"y":-480,
			"width":187,
			"height":60,
			"color":"#000000"
		},
		{
			"id":"81a0f85361dcc0ed",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"`log_j.md`",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":960,
			"y":880,
			"width":140,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"e17170481ac0c19d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"\nReview the inline annotations in research.md. Update the document to fully address each annotation. Append a 'Changelog' section briefly summarizing what you changed and why.",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"predefined-process","textAlign":"center"},
			"x":1520,
			"y":-390,
			"width":560,
			"height":160,
			"color":"6"
		},
		{
			"id":"e4e128fbb51e85a3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"\nAnalyze the provided repository. Generate a `research.md` file that outlines your understanding. You MUST include \n1. The core architecture and tech stack\n2. Key dependencies and their purposes \n3. The data flow of the primary application \n4. Any obvious technical constraints or missing edge cases. Do not write any code yet.\n",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"predefined-process","textAlign":"center"},
			"x":1520,
			"y":-720,
			"width":520,
			"height":240,
			"color":"6"
		},
		{
			"id":"f66fb4e40f1ce4a1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"\nGoal: [Insert specific goal here]. Based on research.md, create a plan.md file. Break the execution down into sequential, manageable Phases. For each Phase, specify: \n1. The objective\n2. Files to create/modify \n3. The automated or manual tests to validate this phase\n4. Clear acceptance criteria.",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"predefined-process","textAlign":"center"},
			"x":1520,
			"y":-40,
			"width":560,
			"height":260,
			"color":"6"
		},
		{
			"id":"f305ed573b5d5711",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"\nReview the inline annotations in plan.md. Update the document to fully address each annotation. Append a 'Changelog' section briefly summarizing what you changed and why.\n",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"predefined-process","textAlign":"center"},
			"x":1520,
			"y":270,
			"width":560,
			"height":160,
			"color":"6"
		},
		{
			"id":"e2e52923fc67b55f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"\n`plan.md`",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":750,
			"y":180,
			"width":134,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"1b8290a64731c9c2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Implement with tests/validations\n",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":581,
			"y":920,
			"width":193,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"4b8f47a3435f8fac",
