		{
			"id":"8be8eb53eea74aee",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Review",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":626,
			"y":320,
			"width":107,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"09560de3d28d909a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"inline annotations",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":868,
			"y":460,
			"width":210,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"02ec47d59cb0866c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"annotate `log.md`",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":841,
			"y":1220,
			"width":205,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"1083a6c75e1a5cd0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"send to agent",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center","shape":"pill"},
			"x":595,
			"y":735,
			"width":165,
			"height":60,
			"color":"6"
		},
		{
			"id":"3b5d9e1e86304e32",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"send to agent",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center","shape":"pill"},
			"x":890,
			"y":320,
			"width":165,
			"height":60,
			"color":"6"
		},
		{
			"id":"ade6764698b44a78",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"\n\n **ROLE & OBJECTIVE** You are executing a phased software implementation. You must strictly isolate your attention to the current phase to prevent context degradation and scope creep.\n\n **OPERATIONAL WORKFLOW** Follow these steps in exact order: \n **1. State Assessment**\n - Analyze `plan.md` to identify the next uncompleted Phase.\n - Identify the explicitly listed 'Dependencies' for this target Phase.\n \n**2. Context Isolation**\n - If the target Phase has dependencies, retrieve and read ONLY the specific `log_[X].md` files that match those dependencies.   \n- Do NOT request, infer, or hallucinate the contents of any other historical log files.\n- _(Note: If this is Phase 1, or there are no explicit dependencies, bypass this step)._\n \n **3. Execution** \n - Write the code and execute the tests required ONLY for the target Phase.\n - Do not write code for future phases, even if it seems efficient to do so now.\n\n **4. Developer Diary (Logging)**\n - Create a NEW file in the logs directory named `log_[TargetPhaseNumber].md` (e.g., `log_4.md`).\n - Write a developer diary for human collaborators. You must include:\n     - **Architecture:** How the new components interact with existing dependencies.\n     - **Reasoning:** Why you chose this specific implementation path.\n     - **Logic Map:** A clear breakdown of any complex logic or edge cases handled, ensuring the user can maintain an accurate mental model.\n    - **Test Results:** The outcome of the phase's validation steps.\n \n **5. Halt Condition**\n - Stop all execution immediately after generating the log file.\n - Output a brief confirmation that the phase is complete and await explicit user approval before proceeding to the next phase.\n\n",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"predefined-process","textAlign":"center"},
			"x":1520,
			"y":540,
			"width":760,
			"height":440,
			"color":"6"
		},
		{
			"id":"6b03a8cd2f7a8d76",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"\nReview the latest annotations in log.md and the provided test/error outputs. Identify the root cause, implement code fixes for the current phase, and update log.md detailing the solution.\n",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"predefined-process","textAlign":"center"},
			"x":1520,
			"y":1020,
			"width":560,
			"height":200,
			"color":"6"
		}
	],
